  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Support to UNOPS Amman for Peace Support Project (PSP) Yemen 2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till UNOPS f&#xf6;r Peace Support Project (PSP) i Jemen 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till Peace Support Project (PSP), som genomf&#xf6;rs av FN:s s&#xe4;ndebuds kontor i Jemen (OSESGY) med administrativt st&#xf6;d av UNOPS Amman Operational Hub, syftar till att st&#xf6;dja FN-s&#xe4;ndebudets anstr&#xe4;ngningar att s&#xf6;ka en politisk l&#xf6;sning p&#xe5; konflikten i Jemen. Den planerade verksamheten syftar till att st&#xe4;rka f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r en fredlig l&#xf6;sning p&#xe5; den p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende konflikten, och d&#xe4;rmed m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra hantering av den allvarliga humanit&#xe4;ra situationen i landet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">he support to the Peace Support Project (PSP), implemented by the Office of the UN Envoy in Yemen (OSESGY) with the administrative support of the UNOPS Amman Operational Hub, aims to support the efforts of the UN Envoy to seek a political solution to the conflict in Yemen. The planned activities aim to strengthen the conditions for a peaceful solution to the ongoing conflict, and thereby enable management of the serious humanitarian situation in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
